{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangular box has integer side lengths in the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/d/6fd9fbf202c5de95ce83bf5e1bdaeb0d374b7d72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1: 3: 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" />. Which of the following could be the volume of the box?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/070d147c2d04864c90be0c63134c111cf4485a71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 56\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 64\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 96\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the smallest side length be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then the volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/27038f06f89487dbd4bac164e3bed017dadc1bb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\cdot 3x \\cdot 4x =12x^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/c/04cc2b78d3d9e7d1d1534308d2292f82d6c1f1d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12x^3 = 96 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 96.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"198\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As seen in the first solution, we end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/7/6b7fce1b591d9a9150b1f977d59f766c9b5290df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12x^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />. Taking the answer choices and dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/a/d1a8af08b2ea45399e120629de2356c54589da47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A) 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/140a53679f07dc651c7b1d0a04580644cce3b1d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B) 4 \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/1/0212d552cabefeaaf22930654e98d5b137d899df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(C) 5 \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/9255836ab51b06c5b34a75fb95b842c76667e18c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(D) 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/6/1b676f531bc5c3356c599fa0d618a765851241d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(E) 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" /> and the final answer has to equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/48524d3889ec8433cb03669176e738011df245b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />. The only answer choice that works is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4066cd24c53cd4053f840d210f974f46e1d913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(D)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bc-somFWrbg\">https://youtu.be/bc-somFWrbg</a>\n</pre>\n<p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=512\">https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=512</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Msaux-erFJ0\">https://youtu.be/Msaux-erFJ0</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4zTfNAWEzys\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4zTfNAWEzys</a>\n</p><p>~IBHishere\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by cutoffchaser\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8FDpvpdCbc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8FDpvpdCbc</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A\">2016 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=